# .errataignore — the hard control over what errata may read or send.
# Paths, content keywords and tags listed here are dropped from hunks and
# narrative before anything leaves this machine, and an ignored path yields no
# symbol anchor at all. Scrubbing is best effort; this list is absolute.
# A personal list can only add to the organization's list, never weaken it.

# secrets and environment
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
secrets/
credentials*

# fixtures and captured data
fixtures/
**/testdata/
*.dump
*.sql.gz
